The FCS version of The NeWS Toolkit (2.0) is now available.
The following compressed tar files contain the code and
documentation for TNT2.0 and GNT:

TNT2.0_FCS.tar.Z		The TNT2.0 and GNT code
TNT2.0_FCS_ReleaseNotes.tar.Z	TNT2.0 Installation Guide and Release Notes
TNT2.0_FCS_RefMan.tar.Z 	The NeWS Toolkit Reference Manual
TNT2.0_FCS_GNTMan.tar.Z		GNT: The NeWS Toolkit Code Generator for
				     OpenWindows Developer's Guide


-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

TNT2.0 FCS on CD-ROM can be ordered through the Sun Internal
Price List.  Hard-copy documentation is included.
The Marketing Part Number is:

TNT-2.0-4-4-21


TNT2.0 FCS documentation is also available from copyrequest@sun:

800-5768-10  TNT2.0 Installation Guide and Release Notes
800-5543-10  The NeWS Toolkit Reference Manual
800-5542-10  GNT: The NeWS Toolkit Code Generator for OpenWindows
